---

## Integration & verification

Once both branches merge:
1. `npm test` — all green, coverage holds (esp. `src/spotify.js` per-file 90/75/100).
2. `npx biome check .` — clean (pre-commit hook runs both).
3. Manual E2E (`npm start`, Premium account):
   - **Re-login** (scope changed) — approve the new "control playback" permission.
