Thrown error messages (B maps these to UI state): `TOKEN_EXPIRED`, `RATE_LIMITED:<n>`, `PLAYBACK_UNAVAILABLE` (403), `NO_ACTIVE_DEVICE` (404), `SPOTIFY_ERROR:<status>`.

**`NowPlayingCard` props** (owned entirely by B): `track` (shape above), `placeName: string`, `onPlayPause: () => void`, `onNext: () => void`, `controlMessage: string | null`.

---

