     if (byStatus[response.status]) return byStatus[response.status]();
     return response.ok ? null : new Error(`SPOTIFY_ERROR:${response.status}`);
   }
   ```

3. **Widen `fetchCurrentlyPlaying`** — keep `204 → null` early return, then use the helper; return the full contract `track` shape (primary `artistName` preserved for geo lookup, add `artistNames`, `trackId`, `isPlaying`, `progressMs`, `durationMs`):
   ```js
   if (response.status === 204) return null;
   const err = spotifyError(response);
   if (err) throw err;
   const data = await response.json();
   if (!data.item) return null;
   return { trackName: data.item.name,
            artistName: data.item.artists[0]?.name ?? null,
            artistNames: data.item.artists.map((a) => a.name).join(", ") || null,
            albumImageUrl: data.item.album.images[0]?.url ?? null,
            trackId: data.item.id, isPlaying: data.is_playing,
